   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "### Observation – Data Cleaning\n",
    "\n",
    "In this exercise, I performed data cleaning using Pandas. I identified missing values using `isnull()` and detected duplicate records using `duplicated()`. Duplicate records were removed using `drop_duplicates()`. Missing age and salary values were handled using median and mean imputation, respectively. Finally, I verified the cleaned dataset to ensure that no missing values or duplicate records remained. This exercise demonstrated the importance of data quality and data preparation before performing statistical analysis and visualization."
   ]
  },
