    "### Objective 5: Basic Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "**Observation:** In this exercise, I performed basic statistical analysis on the sales dataset using Pandas, NumPy, and Seaborn. I calculated descriptive statistics, including mean, median, mode, minimum, maximum, and standard deviation. I also grouped the dataset by product to compare total sales, average sales, and total quantities sold. Finally, I calculated the correlation matrix to examine the relationships between price, quantity, and sales and displayed the results using a heatmap.\n",
    "\n",
    "This exercise helped me understand how statistical techniques can summarize data, compare product performance, and identify relationships between numerical variables. The analysis demonstrates the importance of exploratory data analysis before drawing conclusions or making business decisions."
   ]
